{"id":"syste_me","lemma":"système","pos":"noun","rank":562,"glosses":["system (various meanings)","period"],"ipa":"/sis.tɛm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e2/Fr-syst%C3%A8me.ogg/Fr-syst%C3%A8me.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"systèmes"},"formAudio":{"systèmes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-syst%C3%A8mes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je sais comment fonctionne le système.","en":"I know how the system works.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"to function, to work","l":"fonctionner"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Vous êtes une victime du système.","en":"You're a victim of the system.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"victim"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"C'est un bon système.","en":"It's a good system.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good"},null]},{"text":"Aucun système n'est parfait.","en":"No system is perfect.","words":[{"g":"none, no-one"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"perfect"}]},{"text":"Vous ne connaissez pas le système.","en":"You don't know the system.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}